  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A test fails on origin/master: completing an open inquiry's To Do through the child-record route returns 409 inquiry.disposition_required and writes nothing.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire: a To Do with no inquiry, or with a closed inquiry, completes as before; a non-To-Do child record is untouched by the check; a lookup fault refuses (fail closed) and is logged.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A test fails on origin/master: a successful disposition enqueues the re-evaluation job for that To Do's subject; the job closes the Signal as ConditionCleared; the stopgap notice text is removed and its test updated.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">TodoDetail shows the 409 as plain words (jest test); build, Signals and filtered ChildRecord tests, full ArchTests, client-lint pass; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
