  <completion>Done 2026-11-27: PR #3273 squash-merged to master (6a5af9baf8; Closes #1991, Refs #1984) after an independent Opus adversarial review and fix round. Completing an inquiry's outcome To Do through the BFF PATCH without a disposition returns 409 inquiry.disposition_required; the re-evaluation writes no human-resolution Decision Record (BR-1), only the one Routine ConditionCleared record the nightly would write (D-145b). Known limit filed: DI-179 #3279 (SmartTodo, LegalWorkspace, the chat tool and the form's Deactivate still close it; owner decision). On dev with the uac-r2 dev BFF deploy of 5cd40984b0 (2026-11-27, master 765a199922).</completion>
